---
title: "initializePublishSaleResults (LegionSealedBidAuctionSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: initializePublishSaleResults()
    q_check_auth --> q_check_timing: caller is Legion operator
    q_check_auth --> q_revert_auth: unauthorized
    q_check_timing --> q_check_not_locked: block.timestamp > refundEndTime
    q_check_timing --> q_revert_timing: refund period not ended
    q_check_not_locked --> q_lock: cancelLocked == false
    q_check_not_locked --> q_revert_locked: already locked
    q_lock --> q_emit: cancelLocked = true
    q_emit --> [*]: emit ResultsInitializationStarted
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert UnauthorizedAccess
    q_revert_timing --> [*]: revert TimingViolation
    q_revert_locked --> [*]: revert CancellationLocked

    note right of q_lock
        INV-001: cancelLocked is monotonic false->true
        INV-002: once locked, cancel() permanently disabled
        INV-003: must be called before publishSaleResults
    end note
